# .architecture — Siddharth Fit

## Rendering Model

Server Components are the default. Client Components are used only for:

- Theme switcher (requires `useState`, `useEffect`, localStorage)
- Pointer parallax / 3D tilt (requires pointer events)
- Search dialog (requires client-side index and keyboard shortcuts)
- Contact form interaction (requires `mailto:` construction)
- Animated navigation state (mobile menu toggle)

Do NOT wrap entire pages in `"use client"`.

## Route Structure

```
app/
├── layout.tsx               # Root layout (fonts, theme provider, nav, footer)
├── page.tsx                 # Homepage
├── not-found.tsx            # Custom 404
├── error.tsx                # Route-level error boundary
├── global-error.tsx         # Global error boundary
├── sitemap.ts               # Dynamic sitemap generation
├── robots.ts                # Robots configuration
│
├── about/
│   └── page.tsx             # About Siddharth
│
├── achievements/
│   └── page.tsx             # Achievements listing
│
├── certificates/
│   ├── page.tsx             # Certificates listing
│   └── [slug]/
│       └── page.tsx         # Individual certificate
│
├── testimonials/
│   └── page.tsx             # Client testimonials
│
├── plans/
│   ├── page.tsx             # Plans overview
│   └── [slug]/
│       └── page.tsx         # Individual plan detail
│
├── contact/
│   └── page.tsx             # Contact form + direct links
│
├── search/
│   └── page.tsx             # Search page
│
└── api/
    └── health/
        └── route.ts         # Health check endpoint
```

## Component Architecture

```
components/
├── layout/
│   ├── Header.tsx           # Navigation bar
│   ├── Footer.tsx           # Site footer
│   └── Container.tsx        # Content width wrapper
│
├── navigation/
│   ├── DesktopNav.tsx       # Full horizontal nav
│   ├── MobileNav.tsx        # Compact menu with toggle
│   └── NavLink.tsx          # Individual nav item
│
├── hero/
│   ├── HeroSection.tsx      # Homepage hero
│   └── HeroParallax.tsx     # Pointer parallax effect (client)
│
├── about/
│   └── AboutSection.tsx     # Biography + philosophy
│
├── achievements/
│   └── AchievementCard.tsx  # Single achievement
│
├── certificates/
│   ├── CertificateCard.tsx  # Certificate preview card
│   └── CertificateDetail.tsx # Full certificate view
│
├── testimonials/
│   └── TestimonialCard.tsx  # Single testimonial
│
├── plans/
│   ├── PlanCard.tsx         # Plan overview card
│   └── PlanDetail.tsx       # Full plan view
│
├── contact/
│   ├── ContactForm.tsx      # mailto: form (client)
│   └── SocialLinks.tsx      # Direct contact links
│
├── effects/
│   ├── ScrollReveal.tsx     # Intersection-based reveal (client)
│   ├── TiltCard.tsx         # 3D pointer tilt (client)
│   └── CSS3DObject.tsx      # Decorative 3D shape (client)
│
├── search/
│   └── SearchDialog.tsx     # Cmd+K search (client)
│
├── theme/
│   └── ThemeToggle.tsx      # Light/Dark/System switcher (client)
│
├── ui/
│   ├── Button.tsx           # Primary/secondary button
│   ├── Badge.tsx            # Category/tag badge
│   ├── Card.tsx             # Base card surface
│   └── SectionHeading.tsx   # Section title + subtitle
│
└── seo/
    └── StructuredData.tsx   # JSON-LD script injection
```

## Data Architecture

```
content/
├── site.ts                  # Brand metadata (name, URL, email, description)
├── plans.ts                 # Plan[] with pricing, features, CTAs
├── achievements.ts          # Achievement[] with year, org, category
├── certificates.ts          # Certificate[] with issuer, credential, image
├── testimonials.ts          # Testimonial[] with name, role, quote
└── social.ts                # SocialLink[] with platform, URL, label
```

Content is separated from UI. Migration path:

```
Static TS files → JSON/MDX → CMS API → Database
```

No migration requires rebuilding the frontend component layer.

## Type System

```
types/
└── content.ts
    ├── Plan
    ├── Achievement
    ├── Certificate
    ├── Testimonial
    ├── SocialLink
    ├── TrainerProfile
    └── SiteConfig
```

No `any`. Discriminated unions where appropriate.

## Theme System

Three modes: Light, Dark, System.

- Preference persisted in `localStorage`
- Initial theme: System (`prefers-color-scheme`)
- No flash of incorrect theme (script in `<head>` before hydration)
- CSS custom properties controlled by `data-theme` attribute on `<html>`

## Image Pipeline

- All raster images through `next/image`
- AVIF preferred, WebP fallback
- Responsive `sizes` attribute
- `priority` only on hero image
- Lazy loading everywhere else
- Explicit `width` and `height` to prevent layout shift

## Animation Rules

Allowed properties: `opacity`, `transform` (translate, scale, rotate)

Forbidden in animation: `width`, `height`, `top`, `left`, `box-shadow`

Maximum three primary visual effects:
1. Pointer parallax (hero)
2. Scroll reveal (sections)
3. 3D tilt (selected cards)

All effects respect `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`.
